SUMMARY:Dry Creek Station at The Bird
DESCRIPTION:Dry Creek Station brings their signature Northern California country-rock sound to The Bird in Santa Rosa for a fun summer evening of live music\, dancing\, and great food on the outdoor stage. Featuring powerful male and female lead vocals\, tight harmonies\, and a full seven-piece band\, Dry Creek Station performs a crowd-pleasing mix of modern country hits\, classic rock favorites\, and high-energy dance songs. \nThe Bird’s relaxed outdoor setting\, craft cocktails\, and locally inspired menu make it the perfect spot to enjoy live music with friends on a warm Sonoma County evening. Whether you’re coming to dance\, sing along\, or just enjoy the atmosphere\, expect a lively night of entertainment from one of the North Bay’s favorite live bands.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/dry-creek-station-at-the-bird/
