SUMMARY:Joshua James Jackson + Elena Lambertson
DESCRIPTION:$15 General Admission\nDoors at 7:30pm.\nShow from 8:15-10:30pm with one intermission \nJoshua James Jackson has just moved back to Sonoma County after a ceremonial decade of life in the East Bay. He writes pretty dang good songs you probably haven’t heard\, and since he’s spent the bulk of his life onstage playing music\, his show is pretty good too. His tunes are either heartbreakers or lovemakers depending on the day. Come on down and welcome this man home.\nhttps://www.instagram.com/joshuajamesjackson\nhttps://www.facebook.com/joshuajamesjacksonmusic\nhttps://www.joshuajamesjackson.com \nElena Lambertson is a singer\, songwriter\, and guitarist who lives in Sonoma County. Inspired by the rural beauty of her hometown\, she plays a medley of heartfelt originals blended with her favorite folk\, bluegrass\, and country music.\nhttps://www.elenalambertson.com/\nhttp://instagram.com/elenalambertson\nhttps://www.facebook.com/ElenaLambertsonMusic/ \nAll proceeds from this show will go directly to local artists who will use the funds to continue to survive\, write and pay rent in Sonoma County.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/joshua-james-jackson-elena-lambertson/
