DESCRIPTION:We invite you to join us for a delightful afternoon in our enchanted Culinary Garden. Embrace the beauty of our Estate as we come together for good company\, amazing wine\, and culinary delights. \nOur Kendall-Jackson Garden Party will feature delicious bites from our Culinary Team paired with our current Spring wine club releases\, flower crowns\, live music\, garden activities and more delights. And members – don’t forget to pick up your May Wine Club Release and add-in your new favorite wines to your order!
