SUMMARY:Sonoma County Pride 2026 - Parade & Festival
DESCRIPTION:The Sonoma County Pride Parade steps off at 11:00 AM on Fourth Street\, bringing together colorful floats\, local organizations\, businesses\, performers\, and thousands of community members in a joyful celebration of LGBTQIA+ visibility and pride.\nAfter the parade\, continue the celebration at our Pride Festival in Old Courthouse Square featuring:\n🎶 Live entertainment & performances\n🛍 Local vendors & community organizations\n🍴 Food\, drinks & sweet treats\n🏳️‍🌈 LGBTQIA+ resources & community connection\n✨ Family-friendly activities and Pride celebration throughout downtown\nWhether you’re a longtime supporter\, first-time attendee\, or visiting Sonoma County for Pride weekend\, everyone is welcome to celebrate with us.\n📍 Downtown Santa Rosa & Old Courthouse Square\n📅 Saturday\, June 6\, 2026\n⏰ Parade at 11:00 AM | Festival to follow\nCome celebrate love\, authenticity\, and community at Sonoma County Pride 2026!
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/sonoma-county-pride-2026-parade-festival/
