SUMMARY:Whitewater Rodeo on Santa Rosa Creek
DESCRIPTION:Join Santa Rosa Water for a romp down the creek! With the help of our team\, or at home ahead of time\, build a toy boat\, and then race it down the shallow rapids of Santa Rosa Creek. There will be laughs and prizes; everyone is a winner! Wear shoes that can get wet (no sandals). Don’t have time to build a boat? Materials and assistance will be available that morning to craft your own vessel. Children must be accompanied by an adult. This event is intended for ages 5+. This event will be following our June 6 Saturday Creek Cleanup. Feel free to come early and join in on the cleanup fun! \nPlease register at the event link.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/whitewater-rodeo-on-santa-rosa-creek/
