SUMMARY:Celtic Festival 2026
DESCRIPTION:Live traditional music\, delicious food and baked goods\, Irish and Scottish dancing performances and lessons\, Highland Games\, archery\, St. Brigid’s Tea Room\, crafts to make and purchase\, raffle prizes\, and much much more! \nFREE ADMISSION \n12:00 ~ Festival opens\n12:00-2:00 ~ St. Brigid’s Tea Room open\n12:00-2:00 ~ Open Trad Session (bring your instruments!)\n1:00-1:30 ~ Irish Ceili Dance Lesson (beginners welcome!)\n2:00-2:30 ~ Live trad music on-stage\n2:30-3:00 ~ Scottish Dancing on-stage (feat. Ron Wallace and his dancers)\n3:00-3:30 ~ Irish Dancing on-stage (feat. Shiloh Step Irish Dance)\n3:30-4:15 ~ Bagpipe Procession & Scottish Country Dancing Lesson (beginners welcome!)\n4:15-5:00 ~ Highland Games (adults’ & children’s categories)\n5:00-6:00 ~ Dinner Entertainment (feat. Rogues Regiment)\n6:15 ~ Vespers Service in the chapel \nCheck out our Facebook event page for announcements\, further details\, and parking information!
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/celtic-festival-2026/
