SUMMARY:Summer Bar(n) Crawl at Charlie's Acres
DESCRIPTION:The almighty Bar(n) Crawl — one of our signature events at Charlie’s Acres — is back! Grab some local wine at each barn\, enjoy a tasty plant-based BBQ picnic lunch\, and meet and treat the rescued animals who call our sanctuary home. \nWhat you can look forward to at this 21+ event:\n-During a walk around our sanctuary loop\, you’ll treat our friendly residents to gentle affection and treats — including a watermelon smash! — all while our staff and volunteers share the animals’ rescue stories and fun details about their unique personalities.\n-Sip and savor with a tasting experience sponsored by Etude Winery and Tomorrow Cellars (featuring non-alcoholic wine).\n-A BBQ picnic lunch provided by Nova Terra Kitchen & Creamery.\nAbout our Organization:\nLocated in Sonoma\, California\, Charlie’s Acres is a 501(c)(3) non-profit dedicated to the care of rescued farmed animals. We serve as a sanctuary where our 150 animal residents can live out their natural lives in peace and as a venue for showing the general public that these intelligent beings deserve our compassion.\nProceeds from this event benefit the care of our rescued animal residents and our free humane education programs for schools. \nQuestions? Check out our FAQ on what to expect during a visit to the sanctuary or contact us at info@charliesacres.org. \nTickets are available at BarnCrawl.com for staggered entry times at 1:00\, 1:15\, 1:30\, and 1:45 pm.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/summer-barn-crawl-at-charlies-acres/
LOCATION:Charlie’s Acres Farm Animal Sanctuary\, 3201 Napa Rd\, Sonoma\, CA
CATEGORIES:Other
