SUMMARY:Open Studios for Robert Ochs + 20 artists
DESCRIPTION:Join us at Fulton Crossing for the opening of Robert Ochs new show\, FROM FIGURE TO LANDSCAPE\, exploring the space between representation and abstraction.\nThis collection moves fluidly between figure and landscape\, focusing on the essential elements of painting—shape\, line\, color\, texture\, and form—inviting viewers to find their own interpretation within the work.\nSaturday\, June 6th\, 2026 1:00 – 4:00 PM\nLive guitarist\, open studios\, and refreshments
